---
title: Booking state machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: request mode
    [*] --> confirmed: instant mode, checks pass
    pending --> confirmed: host accepts
    pending --> declined: host declines with reason
    pending --> expired: job after 24 h
    pending --> cancelled: guest withdraws
    confirmed --> cancelled: guest, host or admin
    confirmed --> completed: job at check-out + 2 h
    confirmed --> disputed: R2
    completed --> disputed: within 14 days (R2)
    disputed --> completed: admin resolves
    disputed --> cancelled: admin resolves with refund
    declined --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    completed --> [*]
